SUMMARY:Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed | Staff Selects
DESCRIPTION:The lovable\, easily frightened Great Dane Scooby-Doo returns
  to the big screen when Scooby and the Mystery Inc. sleuths (Freddie Prin
 ze Jr.\, Sarah Michelle Gellar\, Matthew Lillard\, Linda Cardellini) conf
 ront an anonymous masked villain plotting to take over the city of Coolsv
 ille using a monster machine that creates Mystery Inc.'s classic foes suc
 h as the Pterodactyl Ghost\, the Black Knight Ghost\, and the 10\,000 Vol
 t Ghost. Meanwhile\, the gang's detecting abilities are scrutinized by re
 lentless reporter Heather Jasper-Howe (Alicia Silverstone)\, aided by mus
 eum curator Patrick Wisely (Seth Green)\, and thwarted by nasty Jeremiah 
 Wickles (Peter Boyle). [93 min\; comedy\; English]
