 Linda Cardellini) confront an anonymous masked villain plotting to take o
 ver the city of Coolsville using a monster machine that creates Mystery I
 nc.'s classic foes such as the Pterodactyl Ghost\, the Black Knight Ghost
 \, and the 10\,000 Volt Ghost. Meanwhile\, the gang's detecting abilities
  are scrutinized by relentless reporter Heather Jasper-Howe (Alicia Silve
 rstone)\, aided by museum curator Patrick Wisely (Seth Green)\, and thwar
 ted by nasty Jeremiah Wickles (Peter Boyle). [93 min\; comedy\; English]<
 /p>
