SUMMARY:All Creatures Great and Small\, Season 7 Episode 1 | Additional F
 ilms and Guests
DESCRIPTION:Season 7 of All Creatures Great and Small returns viewers to 
 the beautiful Yorkshire Dales in 1946. With the war finally over\, Skelda
 le House is full once again and livelier than ever as our beloved charact
 ers reunite under one roof and look ahead to a hopeful new chapter where 
 James is excited about recent developments in veterinary medicine\, altho
 ugh a new vet in the area threatens the status quo. Packed with warmth\, 
 humor\, and community spirit\, this season brings more heartwarming tales
  of people and animals alike. [50 min\; drama\; English]
