SUMMARY:Niagara w/ Special Guest | Matinee Classics
DESCRIPTION:When newlyweds Polly (Jean Peters) and Ray Cutler (Max Showal
 ter\, billed as Casey Adams) arrive at the famous honeymooning location o
 f Niagara Falls\, they soon meet the provocative Rose Loomis (Marilyn Mon
 roe) and her mysterious husband\, George (Joseph Cotten). Convinced that 
 something is amiss between the Loomises\, Polly becomes even more suspici
 ous when she comes upon Rose in the arms of another man. While Ray initia
 lly thinks his bride is overreacting\, things soon take a shockingly dark
  turn. [88 min\; film noir\; English]Before the film\, we&#8217\;re excit
 ed to welcome performer Madison Avenue for a very special introduction to
  celebrate Monroe and the conclusion of this series.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  When newlyweds Polly (Jean Peters) and 
 Ray Cutler (Max Showalter\, billed as Casey Adams) arrive at the famous h
 oneymooning location of Niagara Falls\, they soon meet the provocative Ro
 se Loomis (Marilyn Monroe) and her mysterious husband\, George (Joseph Co
 tten). Convinced that something is amiss between the Loomises\, Polly bec
 omes even more suspicious when she comes upon Rose in the arms of another
  man. While Ray initially thinks his bride is overreacting\, things soon 
 take a shockingly dark turn. [88 min\; film noir\; English]</p><p><i><str
 ong>Before the film\, we&#8217\;re excited to welcome performer Madison A
 venue for a very special introduction to celebrate Monroe and the conclus
 ion of this series.</strong></i></p>
