SUMMARY:A Cure for Wellness | Staff Selects
DESCRIPTION:Gore Verbinski's visually stunning psychological horror film 
 A Cure for Wellness follows an ambitious financial executive\, Lockhart\,
  as he is tasked to visit an unsettling wellness center in the Swiss Alps
  in search of his company's CEO. Lockhart soon discovers the disturbing n
 ature of the center and those who are seemingly trapped inside with no wi
 sh to venture outside the center's walls. Actors Mia Goth\, Dane DeHaan\,
  and Jason Isaacs deliver a chilling depiction of the consuming nature of
  monetary obsession\, modern capitalism\, and the overpowering drive to p
 ower and success that is commonly sought by modern society. [146 min\; ho
 rror\; English]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Gore Verbinski's visually stunning psyc
 hological horror film <i>A Cure for Wellness</i> follows an ambitious fin
 ancial executive\, Lockhart\, as he is tasked to visit an unsettling well
 ness center in the Swiss Alps in search of his company's CEO. Lockhart so
 on discovers the disturbing nature of the center and those who are seemin
 gly trapped inside with no wish to venture outside the center's walls. Ac
 tors Mia Goth\, Dane DeHaan\, and Jason Isaacs deliver a chilling depicti
 on of the consuming nature of monetary obsession\, modern capitalism\, an
 d the overpowering drive to power and success that is commonly sought by 
 modern society. [146 min\; horror\; English]</p>
