SUMMARY:The Life of Chuck | Escape the Week Mega Marathon
DESCRIPTION:As the world unravels\, Charles "Chuck" Krantz's life is reca
 lled in three acts\, capturing joy\, loss\, and the quiet moments that ma
 ke a life feel full. The Life of Chuck is a genre-defying exploration of 
 what it means to truly be alive and have your life changed—in ways big 
 and small—through the cast of characters you assemble throughout your l
 ifetime. Tom Hiddleston anchors an extraordinary ensemble cast—includin
 g Matthew Lillard\, Chiwetel Ejiofor\, Mark Hamill\, Jacob Tremblay\, and
  Mia Sara—in this Stephen King adaptation by Mike Flanagan that took ho
 me People's Choice Award honors at the Toronto International Film Festiva
 l. [111 min\; drama\, fantasy\, sci-fi\; English]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  As the world unravels\, Charles "Chuck"
  Krantz's life is recalled in three acts\, capturing joy\, loss\, and the
  quiet moments that make a life feel full. <i>The Life of Chuck</i> is a 
 genre-defying exploration of what it means to truly be alive and have you
 r life changed—in ways big and small—through the cast of characters y
 ou assemble throughout your lifetime. Tom Hiddleston anchors an extraordi
 nary ensemble cast—including Matthew Lillard\, Chiwetel Ejiofor\, Mark 
 Hamill\, Jacob Tremblay\, and Mia Sara—in this Stephen King adaptation 
 by Mike Flanagan that took home People's Choice Award honors at the Toron
 to International Film Festival. [111 min\; drama\, fantasy\, sci-fi\; Eng
 lish]</p>
