SUMMARY:Misery | Escape the Week Mega Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Angry that he had the audacity to kill off the hero of one of
  her favorite books\, a lonely woman hobbles and holds her favorite novel
 ist hostage\, giving him no choice but to write a new book\, exactly the 
 way she wants it—and she's not going to let him go until it's complete.
  For his original novella\, King based the character of the unstable fan\
 , Annie\, on Mark David Chapman\, who at some point before murdering John
  Lennon met King and asked for an autograph\, introducing himself as King
 's "number one fan." Misery features a stellar supporting cast\, includin
 g Hollywood legends Richard Farnsworth and Lauren Bacall. Kathy Bates rec
 eived a Best Actress Oscar win for her role as the lonely and depraved An
 nie. [107 min\; thriller\, drama\; English]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Angry that he had the audacity to kill 
 off the hero of one of her favorite books\, a lonely woman hobbles and ho
 lds her favorite novelist hostage\, giving him no choice but to write a n
 ew book\, exactly the way she wants it—and she's not going to let him g
 o until it's complete. For his original novella\, King based the characte
 r of the unstable fan\, Annie\, on Mark David Chapman\, who at some point
  before murdering John Lennon met King and asked for an autograph\, intro
 ducing himself as King's "number one fan." <i>Misery</i> features a stell
 ar supporting cast\, including Hollywood legends Richard Farnsworth and L
 auren Bacall. Kathy Bates received a Best Actress Oscar win for her role 
 as the lonely and depraved Annie. [107 min\; thriller\, drama\; English]<
 /p>
